4. Model Implementation and Evaluation
We will now implement and evaluate the three models required: SVM, KNN, and a Tree-based model (Random Forest).


[ ]
def evaluate_model(model, X_test_data, y_test_data, model_name):
    """Utility function to print evaluation metrics"""
    y_pred = model.predict(X_test_data)
    acc = accuracy_score(y_test_data, y_pred)
    print(f'--- {model_name} Evaluation ---')
    print(f'Accuracy Score: {acc:.4f}')
    print('\nConfusion Matrix:')
    print(confusion_matrix(y_test_data, y_pred))
    print('\nClassification Report:')
    print(classification_report(y_test_data, y_pred))
    return acc

